Please take a minute to review My Active Assignments.
LEx:  https://doextra.lightning.force.com/one/one.app#/sObject/SFDC_Assignment__c/list?filterName=00B1400000AGa9KEAT&t=1476369828397  

Classic:  https://doextra.my.salesforce.com/a0L?fcf=00B1400000AGa9K


Review the list and do the following:
1.  Update the End Date if needed. This date should be the date YOU are done with the assignment…which may be a different date than the end of the project.
2.  Update the Est. Hours if needed. The hours should be a total of the hours you have worked to-date, plus hours you need to complete the work. So if you had worked 50 hours on the task as of today, and you estimated you needed 25 more hours to complete the task, then you would enter 75 in the Est. Hours.
3.  Click on Save.


Thanks!!